per-group unpadded memoryviews, and bounded streaming ring are adapted from
Hugh Madden's Apache-2.0 nodelocal_disk_spec.py:
upstream attribution gist (gist id 03f369339b709a80fd594f4083702722)
Retained source blob: 9c365a4fa5cf42164ef9b40d9528eeb334afed49.
The retained source declares SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0.

MODIFICATIONS
This package ports the native paired-handler ABI, separates portable modules,
replaces the unbounded residency log with bounded SQLite, adds checksums,
file/directory fsync ordering, hard reservation accounting, rank-consensus
interfaces, renewable leases, tombstone collection and CPU fault fixtures.
No old model-specific group exceptions, deployment configuration, shell janitor,
or broad divisor patch is reproduced. The tombstone-before-unlink design is
retained; the janitor implementation is new and has no external shell/SSH calls.

